Enhance the attributes of all holy objects and add many stronger holy objects;

Endless caves, butterfly plains, missile ruins, forest cemeteries, dilapidated libraries, and Abyssal Caverns receive sacred objects every 50 levels they pass through, with higher levels yielding stronger sacred objects; 

The Double Demon King Hall and the Three Demon King Hall receive sacred rewards;

 Fix some game bugs;

 The Secret Treasure Chest has a chance to obtain advanced items.

